Package: bayesmetaipd
Title: Bayesian Random-Effects Meta-Analysis for IPD and AD
Version: 0.6.0
Authors@R: person("Yuan", "Zhou", email = "yuanzhouu@users.noreply.github.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Fits Bayesian hierarchical random-effects meta-analysis models
    using individual participant data (IPD) and aggregate data (AD). Supports
    logistic Simulation Study 2 samplers, Simulation Study 1 continuous
    IPD+AD (nested / subgroup-mean / partial-coefficient AD with density-ratio
    adjustment), and the continuous Application study engine (study-specific
    residual variances; AD report Types 1/2/3). Default logistic settings
    reproduce Simulation Study 2 Benchmark and IPD+AD results from Kim et al.
    (Bayesian-Meta supplementary materials).
